# SMS Spam Filter: Adversarial Testing

## 1. Project Overview

This project implements a machine learning-based SMS spam detector using TF-IDF and Multinomial Naive Bayes.

The objective is to train a model, measure its accuracy, and test its weaknesses using five carefully designed SMS messages.

## 2. Dataset

Dataset: [UCI SMS Spam Collection](https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/228/sms+spam+collection)

The dataset contains SMS messages classified into two categories:

- Ham: Normal messages.
- Spam: Unwanted or fraudulent messages.

The dataset is downloaded directly by the notebook and is not uploaded to this repository.

## 3. Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- TF-IDF Vectorizer
- Multinomial Naive Bayes
- Jupyter Notebook

